WEBVTT

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.340
I feel that things're gettin' worse and worse.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:08.720
They are...

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.990
Each step we take draws us nearer and nearer towards becoming the world's unluckiest pretty girls!

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:57.170
They caused so much trouble before,

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:59.390
so how are they still doing so well!?

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:06.140
If this goes on, Majo Ruka will steal the Queenship, and I'll be completely and utterly finished!

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.230
Majo Rika...

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.190
Is it because they have the word Original?

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:16.400
Then let use rename ourselves as the Head House Maho-dou.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.610
Or the Deluxe Maho-dou.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.870
Or even the Special Maho-dou!

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:22.340
That's not why.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:23.330
Then why!?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.520
Majo Ruka's shop is always having sales

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.330
and many people are going just to see the employees.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.250
Kyaaaaa! He's so handsome!!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.460
Please accept these! Please accept these!!!

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.680
This is the place to do business.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.460
The Road to Being a Level 6 Witch is Long!?

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.060
Are you okay, Majo Rika?

00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:59.980
No, I'm not.

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:02.530
Why do I feel so lifeless...

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:05.280
You haven't done anything.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.850
We aren't complaining even when we're making so many goods!

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:09.710
That's right!

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.490
What are you saying!?

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.290
Wasn't this all caused by you girls!?

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:21.260
Your goods won't sell and I'm getting dragged into breaking Majo Ruka's goods.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.760
That's probably what's tiring you out.

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:27.220
I don't think I can use magic right now.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.690
Eh? Is that so?

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:30.670
I'm at my limit.

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:36.360
If only you girls could hurry and pass the level 6 exam...

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:40.770
That way, I could relax a little bit.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:47.160
~ Long time no see. ~

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:54.170
~ I've brought you some magic spheres. ~

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:57.880
But I don't know if you can buy them with the money you are earning.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:00.340
You shut it!

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.690
Since you're so mad, I won't tell you what I know.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.260
T-Tell us what?

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:09.520
I've got some very good news.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.350
What, what? Tell us now, Dela!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.480
Please.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.400
I wonder if I should...

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.980
Yo, number 1 witch in the Witch World!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.620
That's what I'm talking about.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:23.120
Actually, they're holding a special exam tonight to raise levels.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.070
Tonight!?

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.530
Yep.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:31.000
We're so busy makin' goods to beat the Original Maho-dou, how're we gonna have time to go take the exam?

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:34.500
And I only have 5 magic spheres left.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.920
Me too.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.390
I guess we should pass on this one.

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:41.950
What are you saying!?

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:43.140
You girls have to take the exam!

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:44.110
But...

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:49.600
If you pass level 6 then your Porons will power up.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.410
What do ya mean by power up?

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:53.850
They'll become even more gorgeous.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.110
Really?

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.310
Okay, let's go and take the exam.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:04.000
We must raise our powers at a time like this to fight Majo Ruka.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.280
Yep. Doremi-chan's right on the money.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.490
Let's go take the level 6 exam.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.700
But there's one problem.

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:16.120
To enter the Witch World, you must go through the door in the Original Maho-dou.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:19.990
Noooooo!

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:21.050
Nope.
Noooooo!

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.930
If you want to go to the Witch World through this door,

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:26.550
you'll have to buy back the store first.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.550
Can you girls do that?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:36.890
We can't ask her up front.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.070
This ain't good.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:41.110
If we can't get to the Witch World, then the exam's a no-go.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:44.080
We must! Definitely! No matter what!

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:58.640
We did well today, too.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.800
Revolving sushi!?

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:07.760
Looks delicious!

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.810
Okay, I'll treat everyone today!

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:14.770
Majo Ruka loves her revolving sushi.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:17.280
No wonder you guys were rivals from the beginning.

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:19.170
You even know her weakness.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:21.900
Once they head out to eat revolving sushi,

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.400
we can sneak inside.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:32.300
So slow!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.100
That's strange, why ain't they comin' out?

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.330
Why?

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.080
Sea urchin and salmon!

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:48.340
With my magic, I can make revolving sushi anytime I want!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:53.680
The highest quality tuna! So good.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:56.140
It's no use, she figured it out.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.260
That Majo Ruka...

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.350
What should we do?

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:01.800
Leave it to me!

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:09.460
We'll sneak inside while it's dark.

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:09.880
Okay.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.620
I don't think this atmosphere is too bad, either.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.000
She foiled us again!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.940
Okay, I got this!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.440
Now they hafta come out.

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.700
Just floating on a bubble...

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.470
Have I gained weight?

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.090
We have to think of something else.

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:42.780
Okay. Doremi, make a butterfly appear!

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:43.440
A butterfly?

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:47.130
Majo Ruka loves things that are shiny and colorful,

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:49.400
but she fears butterflies the most.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.360
Got it.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:54.560
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:57.090
Butterfly, come out!

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:02.750
We're counting on you.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.710
We're runnin' out of magic spheres, y'know?

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.140
What's goin' on!?

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:24.970
Too naïve, too naïve, thinking that level 7 magic can beat me!

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:28.680
Why don't you try again!? Or not!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:33.770
We can't take the exam if this goes on.

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:36.530
I feel so tired now.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:39.490
I only have 4 magic spheres left.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.630
What should we do?

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:42.370
Cheer up, Doremi.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.260
It's a bit early to give up now.

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:44.960
Lala.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:48.920
We'll just wait until Majo Ruka falls asleep.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.060
I'll keep on watching them.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:52.860
That works. Thanks, Lala.

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:53.920
Yep.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:58.350
Those brats must have given up already.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.850
If they come again, I'll chase them out.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:03.800
You guys should sleep too.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.950
Yes, good night.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:36.600
What's that?

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.840
I saw it! I heard it!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.160
With those eyes, with those ears!

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:42.720
Don't tell me...

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.060
Don't tell me?

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:45.820
Okay.

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:48.060
Hadzuki-chan, Ai-chan, let's go.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.020
What are you doing, Doremi?

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.700
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:57.670
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:01.680
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.420
Magical Stage!

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.140
Show the true forms of Majo Ruka's employees!

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.830
What is that racket!?

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.000
I got the video.

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:59.140
Your two employees were actually a rat and a bat under a spell!

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:00.180
Right?

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.020
If you let us go to the Witch World,

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:07.060
we'll hand over the evidence.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:13.900
Look what you've done!

00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:16.580
Thank goodness!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.630
But our magic spheres...

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:21.160
We used even more with Magical Stage!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.150
Don't worry about it.

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:24.200
In any case, we can take the exam now.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.270
Mota! Motamota!

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:27.830
We're here to take the exam!

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.000
It's already over...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.660
Ehhh!?

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:30.960
What!?

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.740
It's already morning...

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:33.530
No way!

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:35.090
Help us here...

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:37.300
I'm tired, so no...

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:40.380
Okay, see you later...

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:43.380
W-We finally reached the Witch World,

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:45.280
and you won't let us take the exam!?

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.380
No way...

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.800
That's too much!

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:18.780
We didn't make it to the exam, and we used up our magic spheres.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:20.880
We didn't accomplish anything!

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:24.830
Now we have to do things slowly.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:28.370
Thank goodness we've had a lot of customers already.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.960
But when we buy back the Maho-dou,

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:34.860
we might be old grandmas then.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.500
I'm home!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.520
Welcome back.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.170
Mom, what IS all that!?

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.730
Prizes from the shopping district.

00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:01.340
A year's worth of tissue paper and a watermelon.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.860
When I bought one, the lady gave me two more.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.550
I feel so lucky today.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.680
I know you're lucky,

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:12.810
but if you carry so many things, you might throw out your back again.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:13.910
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.040
Ah, crap.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.940
Okay, I'm done.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:25.400
That's all?

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:28.020
Well, that's all I caught today.

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:30.900
It's pretty filling.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:35.290
For tomorrow's meal, I'll have luxurious sashimi ready, so don't worry.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.290
There's no way you can catch that much fish.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.730
This is what we're having until Mom gets better?

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:42.490
How depressing...

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:47.600
I'm so tired.

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:53.220
I had to make breakfast, clean the house, and do the laundry.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.320
Why are you all aching?

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:57.540
You growing old already?

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:59.730
I'm still young!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.610
Why are you getting so mad?

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:04.430
The young lady's getting mad!

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:07.570
Mad, mad, muscley, muscley...

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.940
I'm even more tired now.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:14.240
What's wrong? You both look depressed.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.040
Is that so?

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:20.040
Don't tell me that you both have family members not feeling well too?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.420
How'd ya know?

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:23.970
So I'm right?

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:27.590
Actually, Baaya isn't feeling very well.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.220
Same here.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:32.850
My dad's had a lotta customers ridin' his taxi lately.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.860
He's really happy, but...

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:37.890
He works so much that he's always exhausted.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:41.360
Well, my mother just sprained her back.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.500
Eh? Doremi-chan's family too?

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:44.400
Yeah.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.860
I feel that we're gettin' unluckier day by day.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:53.090
Each step we take draws us nearer and nearer towards becoming the world's unluckiest pretty girls!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:02.210
I have to go home now, so I can't go to the Maho-dou today.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.670
Why?

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:08.950
Baaya isn't feeling well, but she insists upon baking a cake for me.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.130
I'm a little worried...

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:11.340
Cake...

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:13.780
Ah, do you want to come too?

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:14.340
Can I?

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:14.680
Yes...

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:14.690
Can I?

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:16.770
Then let's go!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.310
Wow, she's really feelin' better now.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:22.750
Y'okay?

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:26.680
Baaya-san's greeting is WAY too powerful.

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:28.280
Is that so?

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.340
I'm home.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:34.030
Welcome home!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:37.400
B-Baaya, you aren't feeling well, so you don't have to come greet me.

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:43.960
No! I work here, and if I do not greet My Lady, then I have failed in my duties!

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.970
Baaya-san is pretty awesome.

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:48.350
Right?

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:49.630
What's that?

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.300
Something's burning.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:55.850
Baaya...

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:57.840
I am truly sorry.

00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:01.810
I have burnt My Lady's cake.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.940
I will bake another one for you at once!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.130
It's okay, Baaya.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.110
You should go take a rest.

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.280
You know I cannot do that!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:15.830
I work here and I must at all costs follow through with my promises to properly take care of My Lady!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.030
W-What should we do?

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:18.980
We've got no choice.

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:22.440
I'll use magic, and you bring Baaya-san to her room.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.040
Okay.

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:39.350
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:44.310
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:47.030
Turn into a delicious cake!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.860
Please let go of me, My Lady.

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:54.050
The cake... I haven't made the cake yet...

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:55.320
Baaya-san.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.820
The cake you baked turned out just fine.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:00.790
Looks good, huh?

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.060
Yep.

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.500
Is that so?

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:08.250
Thank goodness. Now I have fulfilled my promise to My Lady.

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:11.930
I've only got two left.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:14.680
I'm sorry that you had to do that for Baaya.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.080
It's okay, don't worry about it, Hadzuki-chan.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.250
Baaya!

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:21.740
Ya shouldn't be movin' around like that!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:26.650
My work here includes taking care of the backyard every day.

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:28.610
Do you understand!?

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:30.740
Baaya...

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.610
Jeez, let me think of somethin'!

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:51.130
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:56.630
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.870
Make Hadzuki-chan's backyard all pretty!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.780
Oh yeah, I have to go cut the grass.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:06.480
It's fine, Baaya.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.020
Oh my, what happened?

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:12.520
It's fine. Here, go back to your room and rest. Go, go!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:16.990
We're gonna run out of magic spheres at this rate.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:20.310
I've only got two left too.

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:21.580
Me too.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:22.950
Hadzuki-chan.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:27.960
Baaya wouldn't rest no matter what, so I used magic.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.900
Now we all have only two left.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:31.990
Baaya!

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:38.220
I have to stop her!

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:41.640
Go now!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.060
Baaya!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.020
What should we do!?

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.990
We have to use Magical Stage now!

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:54.650
Yeah!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:57.270
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.110
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:06.380
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.980
Magical Stage!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.200
Help Baaya!

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:41.830
We're out!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.260
We used all of 'em up...

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:45.360
No way...

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:50.900
We're completely out of magic spheres...

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:53.670
Now we can't use magic...

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.640
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:57.040
My Lady...

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.450
Well? How are you feeling?

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:00.630
I'm really sorry.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.300
You have to rest.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:05.100
Yep. Rest up so you'll get better.

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:07.400
Thank you very much.

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:09.410
Do you have anything that you want?

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:11.060
I'm sorry to bother you.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:15.590
Oh, there's a good luck charm inside of that box over there.

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:16.610
Good luck charm?

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:20.650
It's one of Majo Ruka's magic goods!

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:22.230
Why does Baaya have this?

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:26.530
The neighbor housekeeper gave me this.

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:31.500
With this, I was able to work much faster.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:35.210
But for some reason I now feel tired all the time.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.920
It's all 'cause of that!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:42.320
Don't tell me that my mom also bought magic goods from the Original Maho-dou?

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:43.730
Maybe my dad too.

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:46.080
Is there something wrong with this charm...

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.020
Baaya, I beg you.

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:50.330
Please throw away that magic item now.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:54.980
It was cheap, that's why.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.620
I knew it.

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.770
Ah, what are you doing? Ow...

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:01.130
This thing is hurting you.

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:05.160
Huh? Aiko.

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:08.100
Dad! Where's that magic item?

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:08.890
What's wrong?

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:09.490
That!

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:10.590
What're ya doin'!?

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:12.810
One of my customers gave me that.

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:16.510
If I don't do this, Dad'll just get even more tired!

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:20.220
I don't care if ya don't make more money!

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:22.450
I don't care if ya don't buy me things!

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:25.500
I'm happy as long as yer healthy!

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:27.520
Aiko...

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:35.560
If this goes on, Majo Ruka will sell even more of her magic goods.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.930
Things just keep getting worse.

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:39.020
Yeah.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:44.760
We want her items to not work anymore,

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:46.450
but we can't do anything if we don't pass the level 6 exam.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:49.910
Magic sphere count: Zero.

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.570
What should we do now?

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:58.810
We are really the world's unluckiest Ojamajos!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:06.510
When I was little, I bought a small harmonica with my dad and mom in Osaka.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:09.170
It's my most precious memory.

00:22:09.170 --> 00:22:12.430
But Dad wants to throw away that harmonica!

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:14.760
This must be because of Majo Ruka's magic goods.

00:22:14.760 --> 00:22:16.480
We don't have any more magic spheres.

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:17.600
What should we do!?

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:19.950
It's okay, we'll try our best.

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:21.820
Let's go! To the Witch World!

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:23.230
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:25.670
Big Turnaround!? Ojamajos' Training.

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:28.600
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
